v1.3.9 (2026-05-28)
-------------------
Fix: SecureNAT status always shown as Stopped in hub NAT/DHCP tab.

- get_securenat now reads SecureNATEnabled_bool from GetHubStatus instead of
  calling the non-existent GetHubSecureNATStatus method, which always threw
  an exception and caused the badge to always display "Stopped"
